From: =?UTF-8?q?K=C3=A9vin=20R=C3=A9mondi=C3=A8re?= <kevin@localhost>
Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 22:28:52 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 01/54] vulkan: fuse UNARY(gelu|silu|sigmoid|softplus) + MUL
 (incl. OP-on-B gate)

Generic fused kernel in unary.comp (UNARY_MUL_FUSION variant), 256 threads x 2 iters,
covers OP-on-B (shared-expert gating: ffn_shexp * sigmoid(gate) tiles into the MUL shape).

- pipeline_unary_mul[4][2][2][2] + ggml_vk_unary_mul dispatch + ggml_vk_can_fuse_unary_mul_pair
- hoist the consuming MUL forward in ggml_vk_graph_optimize
- 8 SPIR-V: {gelu,silu,sigmoid,softplus}_mul_{f32,f16}
- tests: bcast / rep_ne0 / view_mid / gate layouts + GELU tolerance
- test-backend-ops: 104/104 passed on Vulkan0
